    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With ein, kein and possessives",
     "texto": [
      "With **ein/kein/mein**, the adjective shows the ending that the article doesn't express: **ein neuer Film**, **ein neues Auto**, **eine neue Frau**. In the plural, **keine neuen Filme**. In the genitive: **eines neuen Films**, **einer neuen Frau**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Without article",
     "texto": [
      "Without an article, the adjective takes a strong ending: **guter Kaffee**, **gutes Wetter**, **gute Ideen**. In other cases it changes: **mit gutem Kaffee**, **mit guten Ideen**. Learn the ending together with the case and gender."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
